p01 : 182.25
p03 : 7.46
p04 : 63.82
p07 : V4.4
p08 : US Blanks 5'10"RP (2010 catalog vector extraction; target 55 L)
p97 : Versatile. Designed for the modern hand shaper drawing on input from each of the “Fish Fry” events attended (American, Australian, European, as well as Japan). Modified and updated for machine use. Will easily net 5’10” deck measurement with high performance rockers and thickness profiles. With much time abroad put in at the line ups of Africa, South America, elsewhere and beyond the the 5’10”RP integrates input from many of surf designs most traveled exponents minds. We enjoy this blank in the “Greenroom Guild” setting with 4” of center removed for our vision of the high performance fish. Inspired by the futuristic surfing of Daniel “TOMO” Thomson.
